### ShopSecure API playground
### Open in IntelliJ (HTTP Client) or VS Code (REST Client extension).
### Everything goes through the API Gateway on :18090.

@gateway = http://localhost:18090

### 1. Register a user (weak passwords are rejected with 400)
POST {{gateway}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "alice", "email": "alice@shopsecure.dev", "password": "Alice@123" }

### 2. Login -> copy "accessToken" from the response into @token below
###    (the refresh token arrives as an HttpOnly Set-Cookie header)
POST {{gateway}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "Admin@123" }

@token = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

### 3. Who am I?
GET {{gateway}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Public: list products (no token needed)
GET {{gateway}}/api/products?q=key&page=0&size=5&sort=price

### 5. ADMIN: create product (try with a USER token -> 403)
POST {{gateway}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "USB-C Hub", "description": "7 ports", "price": 1299.00, "stock": 50, "category": "Electronics" }

### 6. USER: place order (only ids + quantities, server decides prices)
POST {{gateway}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "items": [ { "productId": 1, "quantity": 2 }, { "productId": 5, "quantity": 1 } ] }

### 7. My orders
GET {{gateway}}/api/orders/my
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. BLOCKED by the gateway: internal endpoints are never public (expect 401/403)
POST {{gateway}}/api/products/1/reserve
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "quantity": 1 }

### 9. BLOCKED: service-token endpoint is internal-only
POST {{gateway}}/api/auth/service-token
Content-Type: application/json

{ "clientId": "order-service", "clientSecret": "order-service-secret" }

### 10. No token -> 401
GET {{gateway}}/api/orders/my

### 11. Public keys used to verify JWTs (call auth-service directly)
GET http://localhost:18081/.well-known/jwks.json

### 12. ADMIN: list users
GET {{gateway}}/api/auth/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
